OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSABirds of prey centre striving to
OL,4,Asave 'nature's binmen'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Vultures are vital in every way
OL,7,Fbecause they're a clean-up service -
OL,8,Fthey're pretty much like nature's
OL,9,Fbinmen," explained Jake Bessant, who
OL,10,Fworks at the centre. "They get rid of
OL,11,Fcarcasses, they stop the spread of
OL,12,Fdisease, they clean up water sources -
OL,13,Fthey've just got a massive importance
OL,14,Fbecause they do a job that not many
OL,15,Fanimals can do."
